loadMacros("PGstandard.pl", "MathObjects.pl", "PGML.pl");
Context("Numeric");

BEGIN_PGML
Evaluate [`(p \lor q) \land \neg q`] when [`p = F`] and [`q = F`]. Enter 1 for true and 0 for false.[_____]{0}

Evaluate [`(p \lor q) \land \neg q`] when [`p = F`] and [`q = F`]. Enter 1 for true and 0 for false.[_____]{0}

Evaluate [`(p \lor q) \land \neg q`] when [`p = T`] and [`q = F`]. Enter 1 for true and 0 for false.[_____]{1}

Evaluate [`(p \lor q) \land \neg q`] when [`p = F`] and [`q = F`]. Enter 1 for true and 0 for false.[_____]{0}

Evaluate [`(p \lor q) \land \neg q`] when [`p = T`] and [`q = F`]. Enter 1 for true and 0 for false.[_____]{1}
END_PGML
